        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Adds active and non-empty sections to the evaluation tree based on the priority defined in the given predicate.\nFor any time range, only the first section of each row (based on the given predicate's sorting) will be added to the evaluation tree, and others will be discarded.\nSections that have a valid blend type are always added to the tree."
